<title>USA: Measurement Specialties sees Q4 revs up.</title>
<headline>Measurement Specialties sees Q4 revs up.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, N.J. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Measurement Specialties Inc said Friday that it expects revenues for its fourth quarter ended March 31, 1997 to be about $6.5 million, up 30 percent from $5.0 million for the same quarter a year ago.</p>
<p>The company manufactures sensor-based electronic measurement devices for consumer and industrial markets.</p>
